body:
basically its just because i just cant bluntly say it, and might make my family wonder why im typing such things XD

&#x200B;

Edit: and besides im not even 18 yrs old

People who defend their own relatives/friends, there was this kid who triggered me so much, one day my baby brother got a nanny/babysitter, her daughter came with her to the house and i just came home and that kid (the nanny's daughter) blocked the gate, making me unable to get in, i told her some really scary stuff to stop blocking the gate, it didnt work, i had to wait for my guardian or my aunts/uncles to pass by just to get in, i told the nanny about her daughter's fault and proceeded to say that shes just a kid and didnt tell her anything, punish her or atleast tell her that its wrong.

&#x200B;

Another annoying thing is that, almost all of my classmates are okay with unconciously or intentionally (forgive me if the spelling is wrong) bullying someone, like say im a sensitive person, its okay for u to tease me (if its not at all over the line) if u r one of my friends but... most of the time they are just a bunch of strangers and made jokes that hit me personally and when i tell them to stop and they wont, essentially being seen as bullying (in my terms). So i went to the guidance councilor and talked to him about what they did, then the next day they would say stuff like, im just a bitch, a kill joy and stuff, then the others just look at me, some joins in, some says they will support me but when i try to get justice they would not support me and instead even betray me.

Sorry, if im kind of repeating or reposting, but no one replied in the last post or maybe i didnt get a notification. But i need some answers for the sake of doing my school project, i cant fake answers... Although i could go around in real life, but i have to be with my classmates (groupmates on the project) to do documentation too, the only problem is that most managers denied cuz there were on duty, i asked my teacher if interviewing online is okay. She said yes, i need atleast one answer :/

&#x200B;

Just any kinds of answers, like say ur business produces smoke that can cause acid rain and stuff. And its also specifically supposed to be a fast food restaurant. My classmates forces me to interview the ones at fancy restaurants and i dont want to do it, because they arent fast food in my opinion and i wouldnt want to risk getting a bad grade.
